<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Obří důl–Sněžka circuit — Pec–Obří důl–Sněžka–Růžohorky–Pec</name><desc>From Pec pod Sněžkou, follow the blue marked path through Obří důl to Slezský dům, climb the red chain path to Sněžka, then descend on the yellow trail over Růžová hora to Růžohorky and follow the green trail back to Pec. This is the complete walking circuit. Use it only in snow-free conditions: the summit stairs and approach close with snow. Check current Czech and Polish park notices, weather and signs before departure; stay on marked paths and obey summit barriers and directional rules.

